   \[
   h = \sqrt{\frac{156(4 + \sqrt{21})}{4(403 + 52\sqrt{21})}
   }
   \]
   \[
   h = \sqrt{\frac{156(4 + \sqrt{21})}{4(403 + 52\sqrt{21})}
